Phase 1 round 3 independent built Chromium probe
Review head 623b295be23e72a1c881d6a7a6bf05cdd8d7b095
Browser aggregate from `pnpm -r build`, SHA-256 6f9cd793d5bfc280c4d604913ff879c9372ddd0b5019134630725c1981717bc7
Repository strict-CSP fixture workflow-canvas.html and its standard violation, request and console recorders.

Probe setup and inputs
Mount ocelle-workflow-canvas inside a 760px-wide host pane in an open shadow root.
Canvas size 720px x 430px. Review origin (24,14), Publish origin (330,236), edge Review Approved to Publish.
Host viewport (0,0,1). Host selects Review except in the capture-only case, where it selects Publish.
Use a host adopted stylesheet. No change to canonical source, fixtures, or CSP.
- clip-path: pane height 445px; clip-path: inset(0 0 220px 0); overflow: visible.
- clip-path-capture: same pane, add that inset in a once-only document capture listener on the trusted native click.
- paint: pane height 250px; contain: paint; overflow: visible.
- overflow: pane height 250px; overflow: clip.
- ordinary: pane height 250px; visible overflow and no other clipping.
- contents-overflow: display: contents; overflow: hidden; no generated pane box.

Wait for the native observer and two animation frames. Take the same idle screenshot crop of Publish in every case.
Press Tab three times from page entry, then ArrowRight and Enter (capture-only case tests Enter without ArrowRight).
Focus the Step combobox and use native ArrowDown, Tab and Enter to choose and reveal Publish.
Apply a proposed viewport through the public property when one exists.
The full request array, trusted input flags, shadow focus and Accessibility.getFullAXTree are recorded after each stage.
Intersection is the last delivered native intersection ratio. Paint is the shadow-root pointer hit test at Publish's center.
The paint hit test also excludes inert targets. Matching idle crop hashes for ordinary and contents-overflow verify that Publish still paints in the boxless case.
Box coordinates in each sample are vertical CSS-pixel intervals. AX records exposed native button names for Review and Publish.

{
  browser: '156.0.8078.4',
  policy: "default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'"
}
